#: angular/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A standalone Angular app (via Vite + `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`, no "
"Angular CLI) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and\n"
"[`@pantoken/angular`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/angular) "
"(pantoken custom elements\n"
"for Angular).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` calls `registerPantokenElements()` (from `@pantoken/"
"angular`) once at bootstrap so\n"
"  elements like `<instui-icon>` work in templates, and imports the token/"
"component CSS plus\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box).\n"
"- `src/app.component.ts` is a standalone component (`CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` "
"lets the template\n"
"  compiler accept pantoken's custom element tags) whose template is styled "
"with `instui-*`\n"
"  classes; optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) "
"are marked with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Una aplicació Angular autònoma (via Vite + `@analogjs/vite-plugin-angular`, "
"sense Angular CLI) estilitzada amb\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"i\n"
"[`@pantoken/angular`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/angular) "
"(elements personalitzats de pantoken\n"
"per a Angular).\n"
"\n"
"## Desenvolupar\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Què hi ha aquí\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` crida `registerPantokenElements()` (des de `@pantoken/"
"angular`) una vegada durant l'arrencada perquè elements com `<instui-icon>` "
"funcionin en plantilles, i importa el CSS token/component més\n"
"`@pantoken/interactions` (connecta comportaments de modal, tooltip i altres "
"components de forma predeterminada).\n"
"- `src/app.component.ts` és un component autònom (`CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` "
"permet al compilador de plantilles acceptar etiquetes d'elements "
"personalitzats de pantoken) la plantilla del qual està estilitzada amb "
"classes `instui-*`; els punts d'inserció opcionals (capçalera, filtres, "
"contingut, final) es marquen amb\n"
"`<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"- Aplica classes com `class=\"instui-button\"` al codi; consulta la\n"
"[referència de components](https://pantoken.app/api/css) per a la llista "
"completa de classes.\n"
"\n"
"## Més informació\n"
"\n"
"Consulta la [guia de primeres pasos](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-"
"started) per a més informació.\n"

#: canvas-theme-editor/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Upload-ready assets for Canvas LMS's **Theme Editor**, plus a local preview "
"for authoring Rich\n"
"Content Editor (RCE) page templates styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — upload these two files under **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** in Canvas.\n"
"  They're built for the CDN provider/theme/mode you chose when scaffolding "
"(`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/rebrand/light by default) and include a loader "
"for\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up component behaviors like modal, "
"tooltip, and drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — a local, TinyMCE-based editor (`npm run "
"dev`) that mirrors Canvas's\n"
"  RCE so you can author page templates against pantoken's classes before "
"copying them into Canvas.\n"
"  The page itself is built with pantoken's `wrapper` layout: click **Edit "
"theme** to open a tray\n"
"  with **Config** / **CSS** / **JS** tabs (CDN provider/theme/mode selects, "
"and syntax-highlighted,\n"
"  hand-editable copies of `theme.css`/`theme.js` that feed the live "
"preview), and the **?** button\n"
"  for full instructions. Use the **Layouts** toolbar button to start from "
"one of pantoken's bundled\n"
"  starter page layouts (hero, callout, two-column, rubric note, "
"testimonial), sourced from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"This opens a Vite dev server with:\n"
"\n"
"- An **editor** pane (TinyMCE, matching the version/config\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) itself "
"uses — see below).\n"
"  Use the **Layouts** button to load one of the bundled starter layouts "
"(this replaces the whole\n"
"  document, after a confirm, rather than inserting at the cursor), and the "
"**Source code** toggle\n"
"  to hand-edit the raw HTML in a syntax-highlighted (CodeMirror) view "
"alongside the editor, with\n"
"  the preview pane updating live as you type — unlike TinyMCE's stock `code` "
"plugin, which edits in\n"
"  a one-shot modal dialog with no live preview.\n"
"- A **preview** pane showing the editor's content with the current CSS/JS "
"tab's stylesheet/script\n"
"  applied (not just the resolved CDN URLs), wrapped to match Canvas's own "
"content-area background\n"
"  and max width — a faithful \"what this will look like once uploaded to "
"Canvas\" check, updated\n"
"  live as you type or edit the theme.\n"
"- The editor and preview panes sit in a split view you can resize by "
"dragging the divider, stack\n"
"  vertically instead of side by side, and swap the order of (drag a pane's "
"toolbar onto the other,\n"
"  or use the **Swap panes** button). Each pane has its own fullscreen "
"button.\n"
"- The **Edit theme** tray's **Config** tab holds the CDN provider/theme/mode "
"selects and\n"
"  **Download theme.css** / **Download theme.js** links; its **CSS**/**JS** "
"tabs are editable copies\n"
"  of the generated files — hand-edit them and the preview picks up your "
"changes directly. Changing\n"
"  a Config select re-generates the CSS/JS tabs unless you've already edited "
"them, in which case a\n"
"  **Regenerate from config** button appears instead of silently overwriting "
"your edit.\n"
"\n"
"## Workflow\n"
"\n"
"1. Upload `theme.css` and `theme.js` to Canvas's Theme Editor (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) so\n"
"   pantoken's classes are available on every page.\n"
"2. Run `npm run dev`, use **Layouts** to start from a bundled starter, and "
"edit it like you\n"
"   would in Canvas's own RCE.\n"
"3. Click **Copy HTML** and paste the result into a Canvas page's RCE (switch "
"to the HTML editor\n"
"   view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — this scaffold "
"doesn't attempt to\n"
"   replicate that, so always verify the pasted result in Canvas (see \"Notes "
"on Canvas's RCE\"\n"
"   below).\n"
"\n"
"## Notes on Canvas's RCE\n"
"\n"
"The Canvas Rich Content Editor runs TinyMCE and sanitizes submitted HTML on "
"the server against an\n"
"allowlist (`gems/canvas_sanitize` in canvas-lms, kept in sync with TinyMCE's "
"own\n"
"`valid_elements`/`extended_valid_elements`). What that allowlist means for "
"templates built here:\n"
"\n"
"- `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, and `aria-*` attributes are "
"allowed on every element —\n"
"  pantoken's `class=\"instui-*\"` styling hooks (and inline `style`, e.g. "
"for CSS anchor positioning)\n"
"  **do** survive being pasted and saved, contrary to older guidance in this "
"file. `<script>` tags\n"
"  are always stripped.\n"
"- **RCE-safe pantoken components**: static/display components — alert, view, "
"heading, text, table,\n"
"  a button-as-`<a>` (not a real `<button>`), blockquote. Stick to semantic "
"HTML pantoken already\n"
"  supports (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, headings, lists, tables).\n"
"- **RCE-unsafe**: anything from `@pantoken/interactions`'s behavior set — "
"modal, tooltip,\n"
"  drilldown, close-button, or any other component driven by the native "
"`popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor` attributes. Those attributes aren't in Canvas's "
"sanitizer allowlist, so\n"
"  the markup survives but the interactive behavior silently breaks the first "
"time the page is\n"
"  saved in Canvas, even with `theme.js`'s `@pantoken/interactions` loader "
"present. Real form\n"
"  elements (`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) and "
"inline `<svg>` are\n"
"  stripped outright — none of the bundled starter templates use them.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` loads `@pantoken/interactions` from the CDN, which runs in "
"Canvas's global page scope —\n"
"useful for interactions on pages you build directly in Canvas's RCE with raw "
"HTML edits, but (per\n"
"above) any `popover`/`command`-attribute-driven markup pasted from the RCE "
"preview here won't stay\n"
"interactive once saved.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Actius llestos per pujar al **Theme Editor** de Canvas LMS, més una vista "
"previa local per crear plantilles de pàgines del Rich Content Editor (RCE) "
"estilitzades amb\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Què hi ha aquí\n"
"\n"
"- `theme.css` / `theme.js` — puja aquests dos fitxers en **Theme Editor → "
"Advanced** a Canvas.\n"
"  Estan construïts per al proveïdor CDN/tema/mode que vas triar en fer "
"l'andamiatge (`--cdn`/`--theme`/\n"
"  `--theme-mode`; jsDelivr/rebrand/light per defecte) i inclouen un "
"carregador per a\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (connecta comportaments de components com modal, "
"tooltip i drilldown).\n"
"- `index.html` / `src/main.ts` — un editor local basat en TinyMCE (`npm run "
"dev`) que reflecteix l'RCE de Canvas perquè puguis crear plantilles de "
"pàgines contra les classes de pantoken abans de copiar-les a Canvas.\n"
"  La pàgina es construeix amb el disseny `wrapper` de pantoken: fes clic a "
"**Edit theme** per obrir una safata amb pestanyes **Config** / **CSS** / "
"**JS** (seleccions de proveïdor CDN/tema/mode, i còpies destacades "
"sintàcticament i editables a mà de `theme.css`/`theme.js` que alimenten la "
"vista previa en directe), i el botó **?** per a instruccions completes. "
"Utilitza el botó de barra d'eines **Layouts** per començar des d'un dels "
"dissenys de pàgina inicial inclosos de pantoken (heroi, trucada, dos "
"columnes, nota de rúbrica, testimoni), obtinguts de\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts).\n"
"\n"
"## Desenvolupar\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Això obri un servidor de desenvolupament de Vite amb:\n"
"\n"
"- Un panell **editor** (TinyMCE, que coincideix amb la versió/configuració "
"que\n"
"  [instructure/canvas-lms](https://github.com/instructure/canvas-lms) "
"utilitza — mira més avall).\n"
"  Utilitza el botó **Layouts** per carregar un dels dissenys d'iniciació "
"inclosos (això reemplaça tot el document, després de confirmar, en lloc "
"d'inserir al cursor), i el botó de commutació **Source code** per editar "
"manualment l'HTML sense format en una vista destacada sintàcticament "
"(CodeMirror) al costat de l'editor, amb el panell de vista previa "
"actualitzant-se en directe mentre escrius — a diferència del connector "
"`code` estàndard de TinyMCE, que edita en un diàleg modal d'una sola vegada "
"sense vista previa en directe.\n"
"- Un panell de **vista previa** que mostra el contingut de l'editor amb la "
"fulla d'estil/script de la pestanya CSS/JS actual aplicada (no només les URL "
"del CDN resoltes), envoltada per coincidir amb el fons de l'àrea de "
"contingut de Canvas i l'amplada màxima — una comprovació fidel de \"com es "
"veurà aquest element una vegada es pugi a Canvas\", actualitzada en directe "
"mentre escrius o edites el tema.\n"
"- Els panells de l'editor i la vista previa es troben en una vista dividida "
"que pots redimensionar arrossegant el divisor, apilar verticalment en lloc "
"de costat a costat, i intercanviar l'ordre (arrossega la barra d'eines d'un "
"panell al d'altri, o utilitza el botó **Swap panes**). Cada panell té el seu "
"propi botó de pantalla completa.\n"
"- La pestanya **Config** de la safata **Edit theme** conté les seleccions "
"del proveïdor CDN/tema/mode i els enllaços **Download theme.css** / "
"**Download theme.js**; les seves pestanyes **CSS**/**JS** són còpies "
"editables dels fitxers generats — edita'ls manualment i la vista previa "
"recull els teus canvis directament. Canviar una selecció de Config regenera "
"les pestanyes CSS/JS tret que ja les hagis editat, en aquest cas apareix un "
"botó **Regenerate from config** en lloc de sobreescriure silenciosament la "
"teva edició.\n"
"\n"
"## Flux de treball\n"
"\n"
"1. Puja `theme.css` i `theme.js` al Theme Editor de Canvas (**Advanced → "
"CSS / JavaScript**) perquè les classes de pantoken estiguin disponibles a "
"cada pàgina.\n"
"2. Executa `npm run dev`, utilitza **Layouts** per començar des d'un inici "
"inclòs, i edita-ho com ho farías en l'RCE propi de Canvas.\n"
"3. Fes clic a **Copy HTML** i enganxa el resultat en l'RCE d'una pàgina de "
"Canvas (passa a la vista de l'editor HTML primer). Canvas higienitza l'HTML "
"pegat al costat del servidor — aquest andamiatge no intenta replicar-ho, "
"així que sempre verifica el resultat pegat a Canvas (veure \"Notes sobre "
"l'RCE de Canvas\" més avall).\n"
"\n"
"## Notes sobre l'RCE de Canvas\n"
"\n"
"L'editor de contingut ric de Canvas executa TinyMCE i higienitza l'HTML "
"enviat al servidor contra una llista de permesos (`gems/canvas_sanitize` a "
"canvas-lms, mantinguda sincronitzada amb la seva pròpia `valid_elements`/"
"`extended_valid_elements` de TinyMCE). Què significa aquesta llista de "
"permesos per a les plantilles construïdes aquí:\n"
"\n"
"- Els atributs `class`, `id`, `style`, `title`, `role`, i `aria-*` estan "
"permesos en cada element —\n"
"  els ganxos de disseny `class=\"instui-*\"` de pantoken (i inline `style`, "
"per exemple, per al posicionament d'ancla CSS)\n"
"  **sí que sobreviuen** ser pegats i desats, contràriament a les guies més "
"antigues en aquest fitxer. Els atributs `<script>` sempre s'eliminen.\n"
"- **Components de pantoken segurs per a RCE**: components estàtics/de "
"visualització — alerta, vista, encapçalament, text, taula,\n"
"  un botó-com-`<a>` (no és un verdader `<button>`), cita de bloc. Manté-t "
"amb HTML semàntic que pantoken ja suporta (`div`, `p`, `span`, `a`, `img`, "
"encapçalaments, llistes, taules).\n"
"- **No segur per a RCE**: qualsevol cosa del conjunt de comportaments de "
"`@pantoken/interactions` — modal, tooltip,\n"
"  drilldown, close-button, o qualsevol altre component conduït pels atributs "
"natiu `popover`/`popovertarget`/\n"
"  `command`/`commandfor`. Aquests atributs no es troben a la llista de "
"permesos de l'higienitzador de Canvas, així que el marcat sobreviu però el "
"comportament interactiu es trenca silenciosament la primera vegada que es "
"guarda la pàgina a Canvas, fins i tot amb el carregador `@pantoken/"
"interactions` de `theme.js` present. Els elements de formulari reals "
"(`input`, `form`, `button`, `select`, `textarea`, `label`) i inline `<svg>` "
"s'eliminen totalment — cap dels andamiatges inicials inclosos els "
"utilitzen.\n"
"\n"
"`theme.js` carrega `@pantoken/interactions` des del CDN, que s'executa en "
"l'abast de la pàgina global de Canvas —\n"
"útil per a interaccions en pàgines que construeixes directament en l'RCE de "
"Canvas amb edicions HTML sense format, però (com es va dir anteriorment) "
"qualsevol marcat conduït per atributs `popover`/`command` pegat des de la "
"vista previa de RCE aquí no romandrà interactiu una vegada desat.\n"

#: components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), Instructure's\n"
"design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` holds the actual page markup — a `wrapper`-layout shell from\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). View source\n"
"  and edit it directly; nothing is injected by JavaScript.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (document defaults + focus ring), "
"`components.css`\n"
"  (`.instui-*` classes), `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, "
"and other component\n"
"  behaviors out of the box), and your own `src/style.css` — add interactive "
"behavior here.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` in `index.html` — replace their contents with "
"your own markup.\n"
"- Apply classes like `class=\"instui-button\"` to markup; see the\n"
"  [component reference](https://pantoken.app/api/css) for the full class "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Una aplicació TypeScript simple (via Vite) estilitzada amb\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"components), els tokens de disseny i icones\n"
"d'Instructure.\n"
"\n"
"## Desenvolupar\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Què hi ha aquí\n"
"\n"
"- `index.html` conté el marcat de pàgina real — un shell de disseny "
"`wrapper` de\n"
"  [`@pantoken/plugin-layouts`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/"
"plugin-layouts). Visualitza el codi font\n"
"  i edita-ho directament; res no s'injecta per JavaScript.\n"
"- `src/main.ts` importa `@pantoken/css` (defineix cada propietat "
"personalitzada `--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` (paràmetres per defecte del document + "
"anell de focus), `components.css`\n"
"  (classes `.instui-*`), `@pantoken/interactions` (connecta modal, tooltip i "
"altres comportaments de component fora de la caixa), i el teu propi `src/"
"style.css` — afegeix comportament interactiu aquí.\n"
"- Els punts d'inserció opcionals (capçalera, filtres, contingut, pista) es "
"marquen amb\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` en `index.html` — reemplaça els seus continguts "
"amb el teu marcat.\n"
"- Aplica classes com `class=\"instui-button\"` al marcat; consulteu la\n"
"  [referència de components](https://pantoken.app/api/css) per a la llista "
"completa de classes.\n"
"\n"
"## Més informació\n"
"\n"
"Consulteu la [guia HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) per aprendre "
"més.\n"

#: next/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A Next.js (App Router) app styled with [`@pantoken/next`](https://"
"www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/next),\n"
"Instructure's design tokens and icons.\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `next.config.mjs` wraps the config with `withPantoken(...)` (adds pantoken "
"to\n"
"  `transpilePackages`).\n"
"- `app/layout.tsx` imports `@pantoken/css`, which defines every `--instui-*` "
"custom\n"
"  property, at the root so it's available on every page, plus the `wrapper` "
"layout's root class on\n"
"  `<body>` and `PantokenInteractions` (a client component that loads "
"`@pantoken/interactions` —\n"
"  wires up modal, tooltip, and other component behaviors out of the box).\n"
"- `app/page.tsx` renders markup styled with `instui-*` classes; optional "
"insertion points (header,\n"
"  filters, content, trailing) are marked with `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [getting started guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-started) "
"to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Una aplicació Next.js (App Router) estilitzada amb [`@pantoken/next`]"
"(https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/next), els tokens de disseny i les "
"icones d'Instructure.\n"
"\n"
"## Desenvolupar\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Què hi ha aquí\n"
"\n"
"- `next.config.mjs` embolica la configuració amb `withPantoken(...)` "
"(afegeix pantoken a `transpilePackages`).\n"
"- `app/layout.tsx` importa `@pantoken/css`, que defineix cada propietat "
"personalitzada `--instui-*`, a l'arrel de manera que estigui disponible a "
"cada pàgina, més la classe arrel del layout `wrapper` a `<body>` i "
"`PantokenInteractions` (un component client que carrega `@pantoken/"
"interactions` — connecta comportaments de modal, tooltip i altres components "
"automàticament).\n"
"- `app/page.tsx` renderitza marcat estilitzat amb classes `instui-*`; els "
"punts d'inserció opcionals (header, filters, content, trailing) estan "
"marcats amb `<div data-slot=\"...\">`.\n"
"\n"
"## Saber més\n"
"\n"
"Consulta la [guia de primeres passes](https://pantoken.app/guide/getting-"
"started) per saber més.\n"

