#: web-components/README.md
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"A plain TypeScript app (via Vite) styled with\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"and using\n"
"framework-agnostic custom elements from\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Develop\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## What's here\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` imports `@pantoken/css` (defines every `--instui-*` custom "
"property),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (`.instui-*` classes),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (wires up modal, tooltip, and other component "
"behaviors out of the\n"
"  box), and `@pantoken/web-components` (auto-registers elements like "
"`<instui-icon>`), then\n"
"  renders markup into `#app`.\n"
"- Optional insertion points (header, filters, content, trailing) are marked "
"with\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — replace their contents with your own markup.\n"
"- Use custom elements directly in markup, e.g. `<instui-button>`, `<instui-"
"alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  see the [`@pantoken/web-components` README](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  for the full element list.\n"
"\n"
"## Learn more\n"
"\n"
"See the [HTML guide](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"# {{projectName}}\n"
"\n"
"Una aplicació TypeScript plana (via Vite) estilitzada amb\n"
"[`@pantoken/components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/components) "
"i utilitzant\n"
"elements personalitzats independents del framework des de\n"
"[`@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@pantoken/web-"
"components).\n"
"\n"
"## Desenvolupar\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"npm install\n"
"npm run dev\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## Què hi ha aquí\n"
"\n"
"- `src/main.ts` importa `@pantoken/css` (defineix cada propietat "
"personalitzada `--instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/components/base.css` + `components.css` (classes `.instui-*`),\n"
"  `@pantoken/interactions` (configura comportaments modals, tooltips i "
"altres comportaments de components de\n"
"  forma immediata), i `@pantoken/web-components` (registra automàticament "
"elements com `<instui-icon>`), a continuació\n"
"  renderitza marques a `#app`.\n"
"- Els punts d'inserció opcionals (capçalera, filtres, contingut, final) es "
"marquen amb\n"
"  `<div data-slot=\"...\">` — reemplaceu el seu contingut amb les vostres "
"pròpies marques.\n"
"- Utilitzeu elements personalitzats directament en la marques, p. ex. "
"`<instui-button>`, `<instui-alert variant=\"success\">` —\n"
"  mireu el [README de `@pantoken/web-components`](https://www.npmjs.com/"
"package/@pantoken/web-components)\n"
"  per a la llista completa d'elements.\n"
"\n"
"## Saber més\n"
"\n"
"Mireu la [guia HTML](https://pantoken.app/guide/components) per a saber "
"més.\n"
